{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01TNM8F237t2knUimN1rdcj5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Jv5PKtFosos2qHhNLJ76Ro","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/coordinator-directives.md","content":"# Coordinator Directives — sos_1\n\n## Engine gap to close (from Tester's untestable.json)\n\nThe card's \"If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\"\nclause IS already covered by tests in `cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py`\n(`test_recast_spell_is_exiled_not_in_graveyard`,\n`test_spell_leaves_graveyard_when_cast`, `test_can_target_a_sorcery`).\n\nThe Tester found that the natural path does not satisfy it: `engine.zones.move_to_zone`\nonly consults the replacement manager when `from_zone == BATTLEFIELD`. A spell cast\nfor free via the attack trigger resolves STACK -> GRAVEYARD through\n`engine.casting._resolve_spell`, which calls `move_to_zone(STACK -> GRAVEYARD)` with\nno `replacement_event`, so a registered redirect-to-exile never fires.\n\n### Directive\nYou ARE permitted (and expected) to make an **additive** engine change to close this gap.\nAGENTS.md allows adding methods/helpers and modifying existing function bodies; you must\nNOT rename/move/delete existing engine symbols. Choose whichever is cleaner:\n\n- (preferred) Make stack->graveyard resolution consult replacement effects, so a\n  registered MoveToGraveyard-style redirect to exile fires when the recast spell would\n  hit the graveyard; OR\n- a card-side custom resolution path that routes the recast instant/sorcery to exile\n  directly instead of the graveyard.\n\nEither approach must make the 3 exile-instead tests pass **without modifying any test file**.\nDo not break existing engine regression tests — verify with the full suite.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1437,"cache_read_input_tokens":25700,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1437},"output_tokens":30,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"d949654a-8bcb-42c0-9da1-7f375481f4d0","request_id":"req_011Cbe46FWFSVafdzdUg13Mc"}
