{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01QeyCQQnCKygEYXVVgHKZs1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017E9aUkBpvgRcMnd4o5JJ1w","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation rationale — sos_1 (The Dawning Archaic)\n\n## Summary\nImplemented `TheDawningArchaic` as a `Creature` subclass and added one additive\nengine helper in `engine/casting.py` to close the stack→graveyard exile-redirect\ngap described in the coordinator directives. All 26 sos_1 tests pass and the full\nsuite (1210 tests) is green.\n\n## Card implementation (`cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py`)\n- **Static data**: Legendary Creature — Avatar, 7/7, `{10}` (purely generic →\n  colorless), `Keyword.REACH`. `Supertype.LEGENDARY` is used as the enum (matches\n  `Supertype.LEGENDARY in supertypes` in the tests, mirroring fdn_244).\n- **Cost reduction** (`cost_reduction`): counts instant + sorcery cards in the\n  *controller's* graveyard only. Returns the raw count; the engine's\n  `get_cost_reduction` clamps it to the generic portion (10). This mirrors the\n  established FDN pattern in `fdn_167` (Tolarian Terror).\n- **Attack trigger** (`register_triggers`): registers a single\n  `AttacksTriggeredEvent` trigger whose condition is `event.creature is self`.\n  On resolution it:\n  1. Gathers instant/sorcery candidates from the controller's graveyard; if none,\n     it is a no-op (handles the empty-graveyard test).\n  2. Asks the optional \"you may\" via `choose_yes_no`; a \"no\" leaves the spell in\n     the graveyard untouched.\n  3. Picks the target card via `choose_card`.\n  4. Registers a one-shot stack→graveyard redirect to `\"exile\"` for the chosen\n     card, then casts it for free via `cast_spell_free(..., Zone.GRAVEYARD)`.\n     The redirect is cleared if the cast raises so a later natural trip to the\n     graveyard is unaffected.\n\n  The decision ordering (yes/no, then card choice) matches the Tester's script\n  `[yes, target_spell, target_spell]`; the helper spells have no `get_targets`,\n  so `cast_spell_free` consumes no extra script answers.\n\n## Engine change (`engine/casting.py`) — additive only\nThe directives noted that a free-cast spell resolves STACK → GRAVEYARD through\n`_resolve_spell`, which calls `move_to_zone` with no `replacement_event`, so the\nreplacement pipeline (gated on `from_zone == BATTLEFIELD`) never fires the\nexile redirect.\n\nRather than widen `move_to_zone`'s replacement handling (which is battlefield-\nspecific and risks regressions across many call sites), I added a small,\nper-game **stack→graveyard redirect registry**:\n- `register_stack_to_graveyard_redirect(game, card, destination)` — record a\n  one-shot redirect keyed by `id(card)`.\n- `clear_stack_to_graveyard_redirect(game, card)` — remove a pending redirect.\n- `_redirect_registry(game)` — lazily attaches `game._stack_to_graveyard_redirects`\n  (a dict) so **no change to `GameState.__init__` is required**.\n- `_resolve_spell`'s body was modified (allowed — body edits are additive per\n  AGENTS.md) so that for non-permanent spells it pops any registered redirect for\n  the card and routes it to that zone (via `engine.zones._DESTINATION_ZONE_MAP`)\n  instead of the graveyard. With no redirect registered, behavior is identical to\n  before (defaults to `Zone.GRAVEYARD`), so existing engine tests are unaffected.\n\nNo existing engine symbols were renamed, moved, or deleted. The new public\nhelpers are purely additive.\n\n## Spec deviations\nNone. The card matches the oracle text and spec metadata exactly.\n\n## Conventions established for future cards\n- For \"if that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\"\n  free-cast effects, register a redirect via\n  `engine.casting.register_stack_to_graveyard_redirect(game, card, \"exile\")`\n  before calling `cast_spell_free`. The redirect is one-shot and identity-keyed.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":440,"cache_read_input_tokens":95162,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":440,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01V47x35JN2jnvC54S4NFizo","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"826c3b58-2b2f-49d0-b29c-27e3b7b54254","request_id":"req_011Cbe4JncMGD3Svi1ghnpxY","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_1"}
