ed) but PASS once the card is correctly implemented.\n3. Do NOT modify any files under `engine_tests/` or any FDN `tests.py`. Do NOT modify engine source. You only write `cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py`.\n4. Confirm the tests are well-formed by running them (they should fail/error because the card is unimplemented — that is expected). Do not try to make them pass.\n\n## Outputs (write these)\n- `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py` — your tests.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/test-rationale.md` — what each test covers and the behavior contract you derived from the spec.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/test-files.txt` — list of test file path(s) you created (one per line).\n- If any spec requirement cannot be tested with the current engine/test API, write `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/untestable.json` — a JSON array of `{\"requirement\": \"...\", \"reason\": \"...\", \"what_would_unblock_it\": \"...\"}`. Omit the file entirely if everything is testable.\n\n## Return (status summary only)\nReturn a short summary: number of tests written, the test file path, and `untestable_count: <N>` (0 if none). Do not paste the full test code."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":186,"cache_read_input_tokens":35844,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":186},"output_tokens":51,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"672adfb1-ab8c-4f74-8bf7-9b048fee27fb","request_id":"req_011Cbe4Z3nZ8JcnhuqAo7mMo"}
