nt`s; player-target accepts players/rejects creatures; any-target accepts player and creature), converge X scaling (0/1/2/5 colors; distinct-color vs. pip counting), the draw clause (opponent or controller as target player; correct top-of-library cards consumed), the damage clause (to a player, to a creature, lethal+SBA destruction), the life-gain clause (controller-only, isolated from the damage target), and one end-to-end cast through `engine.casting.cast_spell` that lets the engine populate `colors_spent`.\n\n**Red phase confirmed:** 18 fail against the empty stub; the 2 that pass (`test_not_a_creature`, `test_zero_colors_is_a_noop`) are static/no-op contract guards a correct implementation must also satisfy.\n\n`untestable_count: 0` — every spec requirement is testable with the current engine/test API, so no `untestable.json` was written.\n\nOutput files:\n- `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py`\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/test-rationale.md`\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/test-files.txt`"}],"totalDurationMs":250055,"totalTokens":90889,"totalToolUseCount":38,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":432,"cache_read_input_tokens":89780,"output_tokens":675,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":432},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":675,"cache_read_input_tokens":89780,"cache_creation_input_tokens":432,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":432,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":21,"searchCount":4,"bashCount":8,"editFileCount":5,"linesAdded":587,"linesRemoved":24,"otherToolCount":0}}}
