{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CmEUEGKoibYZYvDLFLLR42","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Key Decisions\n2\t\n3\tPersistent, append-only log of conventions and design decisions across runs.\n4\t\n5\t## Engine: stack->graveyard exile redirect (from sos_1)\n6\t- For \"if that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\" free-cast effects:\n7\t  `engine.casting` now has an additive per-game redirect registry:\n8\t  - `register_stack_to_graveyard_redirect(game, card, destination)` — one-shot, identity-keyed by `id(card)`.\n9\t  - `clear_stack_to_graveyard_redirect(game, card)`.\n10\t  - `_redirect_registry(game)` lazily attaches `game._stack_to_graveyard_redirects` (no GameState.__init__ change).\n11\t  - `_resolve_spell` pops any registered redirect for a non-permanent spell and routes it there instead of the graveyard; with no redirect registered, behavior is unchanged (defaults to GRAVEYARD).\n12\t- Usage in a card: call `register_stack_to_graveyard_redirect(game, chosen_card, \"exile\")` before `cast_spell_free(...)`. Clear it if the cast raises.\n13\t- Rationale: `engine.zones.move_to_zone` only consults replacement effects when `from_zone == BATTLEFIELD`, so STACK->GRAVEYARD resolution would otherwise bypass an exile-instead replacement.\n14\t\n15\t## Convention: cost_reduction counts (from sos_1)\n16\t- Card `cost_reduction` returns the raw count (e.g. instants+sorceries in controller's graveyard); the engine's `get_cost_reduction` clamps it to the generic portion of the cost. Mirrors fdn_167 (Tolarian Terror). Count only the controller's graveyard unless the card says otherwise.\n17\t## Convention: Converge / colors_spent (from sos_4)\n18\t- Converge X = number of distinct colors of mana spent to cast. Already wired in engine:\n19\t  `engine.casting.cast_spell` sets `card.colors_spent = list(player.mana_pool.last_payment_colors)` (distinct, colorless-excluded, sorted list of `engine.types.Color`).\n20\t- Card-side: default `self.colors_spent = []` in `__init__`; compute `X = len(self.colors_spent)`. No engine change needed for Converge.\n21\t- Player-vs-creature target detection idiom: `hasattr(obj, \"life\")` is True only for `engine.player.Player` (established FDN idiom, e.g. fdn_192).\n22\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01X1Cjv5kQbWsufC3nuUDWwW","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"61877f78-af44-4e4a-a2c9-09cb07b977a0","timestamp":"2026-06-02T07:55:22.637Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_13"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QKb6zx7jDMcvDkWKp4aqXS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"cards\": [\n3\t    {\n4\t      \"card\": \"sos_1\",\n5\t      \"tests\": [\n6\t        {\n7\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py\",\n8\t          \"summary\": \"tests for The Dawning Archaic: static data, cost reduction, attack trigger registration, free-recast and exile-instead-of-graveyard\"\n9\t        }\n10\t      ],\n11\t      \"implementation\": [\n12\t        {\n13\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py\",\n14\t          \"summary\": \"The Dawning Archaic: cost reduction per instant/sorcery in graveyard, attack trigger recasting a graveyard spell for free with exile redirect\"\n15\t        },\n16\t        {\n17\t          \"path\": \"engine/casting.py\",\n18\t          \"summary\": \"additive stack->graveyard redirect registry consulted by _resolve_spell so a free-cast spell can be exiled instead of going to graveyard\"\n19\t        }\n20\t      ]\n21\t    },\n22\t    {\n23\t      \"card\": \"sos_4\",\n24\t      \"tests\": [\n25\t        {\n26\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py\",\n27\t          \"summary\": \"tests for Together as One: properties, two-target (player + any target) targeting, Converge X=distinct colors, draw/damage/lifegain clauses, and full-cast pipeline X==3\"\n28\t        }\n29\t      ],\n30\t      \"implementation\": [\n31\t        {\n32\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py\",\n33\t          \"summary\": \"Together as One: {6} sorcery, X=len(colors_spent); target player draws X, X damage to any target, controller gains X life\"\n34\t        }\n35\t      ]\n36\t    }\n37\t  ]\n38\t}\n39\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01X1Cjv5kQbWsufC3nuUDWwW","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"3ab1d513-cbe1-4ed8-a1ad-e44ab4745586","timestamp":"2026-06-02T07:55:22.638Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_13"}
