ansition, (d) the Swords effect.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-files.txt` — list of all files changed (one per line).\n- Upsert this card's entry into `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: \"sos_13\"`; replace in place if present). Include engine files in the `implementation` array.\n\n## Return (status summary only)\nIf all tests pass:\n```\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: <N>\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: <one-line, mention the engine API names you added for prepared/copy-in-exile>\n```\nIf you must dispute a test (write reasoning to `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-dispute.md`):\n```\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: <N>\ndisputed_tests: <list>\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-dispute.md\nnotes: <one-line>\n```"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1449,"cache_read_input_tokens":56747,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1449},"output_tokens":57,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"ad2d0167-d5fb-4d38-a93a-4a957d511a26","request_id":"req_011Cbe5reaukmRXQjJNuNFDs"}
