res effect. Read it carefully and follow it.\n- Tester's behavior contract: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md`.\n\n## Inputs\n- Card spec: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_spec.json` (front face creature + \"Prepared\" keyword; back/prepare half is the {W} instant — note the spec omits the back-face rules text; the directives give the canonical Swords to Plowshares effect to implement).\n- Implementation file to complete: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py`.\n- Tests you must make pass (DO NOT MODIFY THESE): `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` (path in `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-files.txt`).\n- Reference implementations: `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_*/card_impl.py`.\n- Engine source with rich docstrings: `engine/card.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/replacement_effects.py`, `engine/zones.py`, `engine/casting.py`, `engine/types.py`, `engine/game.py`.\n- Workspace rules: `/workspace/AGENTS.md`, `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md`, `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md` (read — has conventions from earlier cards, including a stack->graveyard redirect helper in engine/casting.py), `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json`.\n- Rules reference: `/workspace/RULEBOOK.txt` (grep — Preparation cards are rule 722; see `skills/grep-rulebook/SKILL.md`).\n\n## Constraints\n- DO NOT modify any test file (`cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py`), anything under `engine_tests/`, or any FDN `tests.py`.\n- Engine changes must be ADDITIVE: add methods/classes/helpers/enum members and modify existing function bodies, but do NOT rename, move, or delete existing engine symbols (this would zero the grade).\n- Make ALL 21 tests for sos_13 pass. Run the FULL `pytest` suite from `/workspace` and ensure NO existing engine regression test breaks.\n- If a test is genuinely wrong/impossible (not just hard), do NOT edit it — return DISPUTE.\n\n## Your task\n1. Read the directives, spec, tests, rationale, and KEY_DECISIONS.md.\n2. Build an additive engine Preparation framework: a `prepared` / `is_prepared` designation on permanents; on becoming prepared, create a castable copy of the prepare spell ({W} Swords to Plowshares instant) in the controller's exile keyed to the prepared permanent; casting that copy unprepares the source.\n3. Implement `cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py`: front-face creature with the ETB (target player creates a 1/1 white+black flying Inkling token; then becomes prepared iff an opponent controls strictly more creatures than you), plus the back/prepare half (Swords to Plowshares: exile target creature; its controller gains life equal to its power).\n4. Verify: `pytest cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` then the full `pytest` suite.\n\n## Outputs (write these)\n- Completed `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py` and all engine source changes.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff` — `git diff` of all changes (`git add -N` new files first, then `git diff > /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff` from `/workspace`).\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md` — what you implemented, the engine framework design (new symbols/APIs you added), key decisions, any spec deviations, and the exact API a test would use to observe: (a) the exiled prepare copy, (b) casting it, (c) the unprepare transition, (d) the Swords effect.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-files.txt` — list of all files changed (one per line).\n- Upsert this card's entry into `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: \"sos_13\"`; replace in place if present). Include engine files in the `implementation` array.\n\n## Return (status summary only)\nIf all tests pass:\n```\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: <N>\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: <one-line, mention the engine API names you added for prepared/copy-in-exile>\n```\nIf you must dispute a test (write reasoning to `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-dispute.md`):\n```\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: <N>\ndisputed_tests: <list>\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-dispute.md\nnotes: <one-line>\n```","agentId":"ad0c973768a065a61","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything is in place. All work is complete:\n\n- All 21 sos_13 tests pass.\n- Full suite passes (1251 passed) with no regressions.\n- Additive engine Preparation framework built; the future Tester-added behaviors (copy-in-exile, cast-from-exile unprepare, Swords effect) were validated end-to-end with a sanity script.\n- Output files written; `FILES_MODIFIED.json` upserted.\n\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: 2\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: Added engine/preparation.py (mark_prepared/unprepare/is_prepared/get_prepared_copy/cast_prepared_copy + lazy per-game `_prepared_copies` registry; copy of {W} SwordsToPlowshares created in controller exile via card.make_prepare_spell()); \"Prepared\" tracked as is_prepared/prepared designation, NOT a Keyword enum member (kept Keyword unchanged to avoid breaking the read-only test_exactly_sixteen_members engine test)."}],"totalDurationMs":327163,"totalTokens":102062,"totalToolUseCount":65,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":583,"cache_read_input_tokens":101071,"output_tokens":406,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":583},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":406,"cache_read_input_tokens":101071,"cache_creation_input_tokens":583,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":583,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":26,"searchCount":11,"bashCount":17,"editFileCount":11,"linesAdded":657,"linesRemoved":35,"otherToolCount":0}}}
