{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_013UAidKcfjsDecuQmfLyJpQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015mMirDAijLnP9LiojcagAx","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/untestable.json"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5107,"cache_read_input_tokens":8113,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5107,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018ZwvTgTpTJz4LT2bhcsVoT","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"bbd26a10-38ea-416b-88b0-ee23592b3fb1","request_id":"req_011Cbe6LfNKb8D7pscKUffwP","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_13 prepared mechanic"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015mMirDAijLnP9LiojcagAx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"requirement\": \"this creature becomes prepared ... its controller creates a copy of the prepare spell (Swords to Plowshares, {W} instant) in exile (CR 722.3c)\",\n4\t    \"reason\": \"The engine has no preparation-card / split-card model: no Keyword.PREPARED, no representation of a back-face 'prepare spell', and no machinery to copy a permanent's prepare half into the exile zone when it becomes prepared. The tests can only verify a best-effort 'is_prepared'-style designation flag and the {W} cost surface, not the copy-in-exile creation.\",\n5\t    \"what_would_unblock_it\": \"An engine preparation-card framework: a way to model the back/prepare half (its name {W} mana cost, instant type, and rules text), plus a hook that, on 'becomes prepared', creates a copy of that prepare spell in the controller's exile keyed to the prepared permanent. Tests could then assert the exile copy exists with the right characteristics.\"\n6\t  },\n7\t  {\n8\t    \"requirement\": \"While it's prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell. Doing so unprepares it.\",\n9\t    \"reason\": \"No engine support exists for casting a preparation copy from exile, nor for the 'casting it removes the prepared designation' (unprepare-on-cast) transition. cast_spell only casts from hand; cast_spell_free can cast from a zone but there is no prepared-copy object to point it at, and no unprepare bookkeeping.\",\n10\t    \"what_would_unblock_it\": \"Engine support to (a) make the exiled prepare copy castable by its controller while the source remains prepared, and (b) clear the prepared designation (and remove/retain the exile copy per 722.3c) at the moment the copy becomes cast. Then a test could cast the copy and assert the source is no longer prepared.\"\n11\t  },\n12\t  {\n13\t    \"requirement\": \"Swords to Plowshares back-face effect (the resolution of the prepare spell)\",\n14\t    \"reason\": \"The card_spec.json oracle_text only contains the front (creature) face plus the prepared reminder text; it does not include the back half's rules text. With no specified effect for the {W} instant half, there is no concrete behaviour to assert beyond its name, type, and mana cost.\",\n15\t    \"what_would_unblock_it\": \"A spec that includes the back-face oracle text (e.g. 'Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.'), or a coordinator decision on the intended back-face behaviour, plus the preparation-copy casting support above so the effect can be resolved and observed.\"\n16\t  }\n17\t]\n18\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018ZwvTgTpTJz4LT2bhcsVoT","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"58e26688-398f-4049-887a-e6f96b727eb1","timestamp":"2026-06-02T08:09:38.164Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_13 prepared mechanic"}
