{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_013UAidKcfjsDecuQmfLyJpQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Upbcudiok41nnnhzzsmQ8U","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/coordinator-directives.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5107,"cache_read_input_tokens":8113,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5107,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018ZwvTgTpTJz4LT2bhcsVoT","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"e58760f6-13c7-4f8a-b073-aa388627b56c","request_id":"req_011Cbe6LfNKb8D7pscKUffwP","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_13 prepared mechanic"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Upbcudiok41nnnhzzsmQ8U","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives — sos_13 (Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares)\n2\t\n3\tThis is a \"complex\"-tier card with a brand-new **Prepared / Preparation Card** mechanic\n4\t(keyword `\"Prepared\"`). The Tester wrote 21 tests for the directly-observable subset and\n5\tdeferred 3 items (see `untestable.json`) because no engine support exists yet. You are\n6\texpected and required to build that support — ADDITIVELY per AGENTS.md (add new\n7\tmethods/classes/helpers, modify existing function bodies; never rename/move/delete existing\n8\tengine symbols).\n9\t\n10\t## Spec facts\n11\t- Front face: **Emeritus of Truce** — `{1}{W}{W}` — Creature — Cat Cleric — 3/3 — white — keyword \"Prepared\".\n12\t- ETB: \"When this creature enters, target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling\n13\t  creature token with flying. Then if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this\n14\t  creature becomes prepared.\"\n15\t- Reminder: \"While it's prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell. Doing so unprepares it.\"\n16\t- Back / prepare half: **Swords to Plowshares** — `{W}` — Instant.\n17\t\n18\t## Required: pass all 21 existing tests (DO NOT modify them)\n19\tThe tests cover: front-face static data (name, `{1}{W}{W}`, 3/3, white, Cat/Cleric),\n20\tthe single self-referencing ETB trigger, Inkling token creation (1/1 white+black, flying,\n21\ttoken, created under the *targeted* player's control — may be an opponent), the conditional\n22\t\"becomes prepared\" (strictly more opponent creatures ⇒ prepared; equal/fewer ⇒ not), and a\n23\t`{W}` cost surface for the prepare half. The tests read the prepared designation via probe\n24\tattributes `is_prepared` / `prepared`, and read the prepare-half cost via\n25\t`prepare_mana_cost` / `back_mana_cost` or a back-face object/factory — expose at least one\n26\tof those shapes.\n27\t\n28\t## Required: build an additive engine Preparation framework\n29\tModel the mechanic so it is observable and correct:\n30\t1. A way to mark a permanent as **prepared** (e.g. a boolean designation / `is_prepared`\n31\t   on the card, and ideally a `Keyword.PREPARED` if you add one additively to the enum —\n32\t   additive enum members are allowed).\n33\t2. On **becoming prepared**: create a castable **copy of the prepare spell** (the `{W}`\n34\t   Swords to Plowshares instant) in the controller's **exile** zone, keyed to the prepared\n35\t   permanent (CR 722.3c).\n36\t3. The controller **may cast** that exiled copy (use/extend `cast_spell_free` or an\n37\t   equivalent path to cast from exile). **Casting the copy clears the prepared designation**\n38\t   (unprepares the source permanent).\n39\t4. Keep it additive and do not break existing engine regression tests.\n40\t\n41\t## Required: implement the back-face Swords to Plowshares effect (coordinator ruling)\n42\tThe card_spec.json omits the back-face rules text, but the name \"Swords to Plowshares\" is\n43\tunambiguous. Implement the canonical effect for the prepare half:\n44\t\n45\t> **Swords to Plowshares** `{W}` Instant — Exile target creature. Its controller gains life\n46\t> equal to its power.\n47\t\n48\tSo the back/prepare half is an Instant costing `{W}` that exiles a target creature and gives\n49\tthat creature's controller life equal to its (last-known) power.\n50\t\n51\t## Verification\n52\t- `pytest cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` → all pass.\n53\t- Full `pytest` from `/workspace` → no regressions.\n54\t\n55\tAfter you finish, the coordinator will re-invoke the Tester once to add tests for the\n56\tcopy-in-exile creation, cast-from-exile unprepare transition, and the Swords effect — build\n57\tthe framework so those behaviours are real and observable, not just stubbed.\n58\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018ZwvTgTpTJz4LT2bhcsVoT","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"a25da8c8-30e1-483d-977e-0cd1321c6898","timestamp":"2026-06-02T08:09:38.618Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_13 prepared mechanic"}
