he source, moves the copy off exile onto the stack (`stack.peek().source is copy`), and clears the registry entry.\n- `TestSwordsToPlowsharesEffect` (3 tests) — item 3: resolving the prepare spell exiles the target creature to its owner's exile and gives its controller life equal to its power; a dedicated test confirms the life goes to the target's controller (an opponent) and not the caster.\n\nNo implementation bugs surfaced — all new tests pass against the existing implementation as intended (the implementation already exists, so these confirm the contract). The deferral list in `untestable.json` is now fully retired.\n\nFiles:\n- `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` (updated — 37 tests)\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md` (appended \"## Extended coverage\" section)\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-files.txt` (unchanged — already lists the single file)"}],"totalDurationMs":122152,"totalTokens":68087,"totalToolUseCount":23,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":261,"cache_read_input_tokens":66972,"output_tokens":852,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":261},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":852,"cache_read_input_tokens":66972,"cache_creation_input_tokens":261,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":261,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":12,"searchCount":3,"bashCount":5,"editFileCount":3,"linesAdded":348,"linesRemoved":10,"otherToolCount":0}}}
