{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Gm9Qk5jJCBCDohEF5nphgU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RVMC8pWzD1khWv5YamS13i","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Revise sos_13 per review","subagent_type":"Implementer","prompt":"You are applying review feedback to your implementation of card **sos_13** (\"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\") and its engine Preparation framework.\n\n## Inputs\n- Your current implementation diff: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff` (covers `cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py` and `engine/preparation.py`).\n- Your rationale: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md`.\n- Review comments to address: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/review.json` (a JSON array; each has `severity`, `file`, `line`, `comment`).\n- Tests you must keep passing (DO NOT MODIFY): `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` (37 tests).\n- Workspace rules: `/workspace/AGENTS.md`, `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md`, `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json`.\n- Engine source: `engine/preparation.py`, `engine/casting.py`, `engine/zones.py`.\n\n## What to do\nApply every `strict` review comment. You may apply `advisory` comments if they are quick and safe (they are optional).\n\nThe key STRICT issue:\n- `engine/preparation.py` `cast_prepared_copy`: it currently unprepares the source and pops the registry entry BEFORE calling `cast_spell_free`. If the cast raises (e.g. `CastingError`), the permanent is left wrongly unprepared and the exiled copy is orphaned. Per CR 722.3c the designation is only removed when the spell actually \"becomes cast\" (succeeds). FIX: cast the copy first; only after the cast succeeds, clear the source's prepared designation and detach/remove the registry entry. Ensure no double-removal of the in-flight copy. On a cast failure, leave the source prepared and the copy in exile (propagate the error).\n\nConstraints:\n- DO NOT modify any test file, anything under `engine_tests/`, or any