yed one-shot trigger). Follow it.\n- Tester's behavior contract: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md`.\n\n## Inputs\n- Card spec: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/card_spec.json`.\n- Implementation file to complete: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py`.\n- Tests you must make pass (DO NOT MODIFY): `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` (path in `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-files.txt`).\n- Reference counter-spell implementations: `cards/fdn/fdn_48/card_impl.py` (Refute), `cards/fdn/fdn_153/card_impl.py` (Essence Scatter).\n- Other reference implementations: `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_*/card_impl.py`.\n- Engine source with rich docstrings: `engine/card.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/casting.py`, `engine/turn.py`, `engine/mana.py`, `engine/zones.py`, `engine/types.py`, `engine/game.py`.\n- Workspace rules: `/workspace/AGENTS.md`, `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md`, `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md` (read — engine conventions from earlier cards, incl. lazy per-game registry pattern and Keyword-enum-must-stay-16-members), `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json`.\n- Rules reference: `/workspace/RULEBOOK.txt` (grep; see `skills/grep-rulebook/SKILL.md`).\n\n## Constraints\n- DO NOT modify any test file (`cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`), anything under `engine_tests/`, or any FDN `tests.py`.\n- Engine changes must be ADDITIVE: add methods/classes/helpers/enum members (e.g. a new event class) and modify existing function bodies, but do NOT rename, move, or delete existing engine symbols. Keep the `Keyword` enum at 16 members (do NOT add to it).\n- Make ALL 21 tests for sos_57 pass. Run the FULL `pytest` suite from `/workspace` and ensure NO existing engine regression test breaks (be careful adding a new event firing in engine/turn.py — verify turn-progression tests still pass).\n- If a test is genuinely wrong/impossible (not just hard), do NOT edit it — return DISPUTE.\n\n## Your task\n1. Read directives, spec, tests, rationale, KEY_DECISIONS.md, and the FDN counter examples.\n2. Build the two additive engine pieces: (a) total-mana-spent tracking per cast (e.g. `card.mana_spent`, set in `engine/casting.py`); (b) a `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` fired from `engine/turn.py` at the start of the pre-combat main phase, plus a delayed/one-shot trigger registration mechanism.\n3. Implement `cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py`: counter target spell (excludes self; counters creature spells too; countered card → owner's graveyard); if the controller controls a Wizard when the counter resolves, register a delayed one-shot trigger that at the beginning of the controller's next main phase adds {C} equal to the mana spent to cast the countered spell (fall back to the countered card's `mana_cost.cmc` when `mana_spent` is not recorded).\n4. Verify: `pytest cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` then the full `pytest` suite.\n\n## Outputs (write these)\n- Completed `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py` and all engine source changes.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl.diff` — `git diff` of implementation+engine files only (exclude tests): `git add -N` any new files first, then `git diff -- cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py engine/ > /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl.diff` from `/workspace`.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md` — what you implemented, the new engine API/symbols (event class name, delayed-trigger registration API, mana_spent attribute), key decisions, any spec deviations, and exactly how a test would observe the engine-driven timing (run_turn → {C} at next main phase).\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-files.txt` — list of all files changed (one per line).\n- Upsert this card's entry into `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: \"sos_57\"`; replace in place if present). Include engine files in `implementation`.\n\n## Return (status summary only)\nIf all tests pass:\n```\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: <N>\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: <one-line, name the new engine symbols you added>\n```\nIf you must dispute a test (write reasoning to `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-dispute.md`):\n```\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: <N>\ndisputed_tests: <list>\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-dispute.md\nnotes: <one-line>\n```","agentId":"a82c1c4eb6334a7e2","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All complete. Everything passes and all output files are written.\n\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: 5\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: Added `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` (engine/events.py, fired from engine/turn.py), `TriggerManager.register_delayed` + one-shot `TriggerRegistration.one_shot` field (engine/triggers.py), and `card.mana_spent` tracking (engine/casting.py); implemented `ManaSculpt` counter + Wizard-gated delayed {C} clause. Full suite 1288 passed, no regressions; `Keyword` still 16 members.\n\nRelevant absolute paths:\n- /workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\n- /workspace/engine/casting.py\n- /workspace/engine/events.py\n- /workspace/engine/triggers.py\n- /workspace/engine/turn.py\n- /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl.diff\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-rationale.md\n- /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-files.txt"}],"totalDurationMs":251252,"totalTokens":80861,"totalToolUseCount":53,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":576,"cache_read_input_tokens":79820,"output_tokens":463,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":576},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":463,"cache_read_input_tokens":79820,"cache_creation_input_tokens":576,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":576,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type