{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WzpFW117PoadTBybnyLMZJ","type":"tool_result","content":"3502:701.25. Surveil\n3504:701.25a To “surveil N” means to look at the top N cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.\n3506:701.25b If an effect allows you to look at additional cards while you surveil, those cards are included among the cards you may put into your graveyard and on top of your library in any order.\n3508:701.25c If a player is instructed to surveil 0, no surveil event occurs. Abilities that trigger whenever a player surveils won’t trigger.\n3510:701.25d An ability that triggers whenever a player surveils triggers after the process described in rule 701.25a is complete, even if some or all of those actions were impossible.\n8996:Surveil\n8997:To manipulate some of the cards on top of your library, sending some of them to your graveyard and rearranging the rest. See rule 701.25, “Surveil.”","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VwgmXR5ZP3SB9uaEJhNUPE","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"223f2525-4fc1-4aaf-b2f0-45a03d8a0211","timestamp":"2026-06-02T08:33:13.315Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_97"}
