u implemented, the new engine API/symbols (coin-flip helper name + how to seed it, skip-turn counter name + where consumed), key decisions, any spec deviations, and exactly how a test would: seed the coin flip to force a known number of heads, and observe the opponent's skipped turns end-to-end.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl-files.txt` — list of all files changed (one per line).\n- Upsert this card's entry into `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: \"sos_97\"`; replace in place if present). Include engine files in `implementation`.\n\n## Return (status summary only)\nIf all tests pass:\n```\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: <N>\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: <one-line, name the new engine symbols + how to seed the coin flip>\n```\nIf you must dispute a test (write reasoning to `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/test-dispute.md`):\n```\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: <N>\ndisputed_tests: <list>\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/test-dispute.md\nnotes: <one-line>\n```"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1560,"cache_read_input_tokens":106169,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1560},"output_tokens":59,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"da8759a5-6289-41e3-8198-b12f58d5984e","request_id":"req_011Cbe8Swu91fHxXtNj96Xg5"}
