{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01RRAP7SjyGweinDSzbQU9ft","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014Q1316Rfv8Hpen3p4PxXFD","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/test-rationale.md","old_string":"- **Surveil reordering of the kept cards** — CR 701.25 lets the player reorder the\n  cards kept on top; with only generic vanilla fillers this has no observable\n  game effect to assert, and the precise reorder API is implementer-defined.","new_string":"- **Surveil reordering of the kept cards** — CR 701.25 lets the player reorder the\n  cards kept on top; with only generic vanilla fillers this has no observable\n  game effect to assert, and the precise reorder API is implementer-defined.\n\n## Extended coverage\n\nAfter the Implementer added additive engine support for the previously-deferred\n−7 ultimate — a seedable per-game RNG (`engine.game.seed_rng` / `flip_coins`) and\na per-player `skipped_turns` counter consumed during turn rotation\n(`GameState._pick_next_active_index`, driven by `advance_phase`) — the two\n`untestable.json` items became testable. Nine new tests were added in\n`TestRalZarekUltimateDeterministic` (file unchanged otherwise; the original 26\ntests are untouched). Total is now 35 tests.\n\nHelpers added for these tests:\n- `_heads_for_seed(seed)` — establishes ground truth by seeding a throwaway game\n  the same way the −7 ability seeds the real game and reading `flip_coins(g, 5)`.\n  Each deterministic test asserts against this observed head count rather than a\n  hard-coded magic number, so the tests stay correct and self-documenting even if\n  the RNG internals change.\n- `_end_turn(game)` — mirrors `engine_tests/test_extra_turns.py::_end_turn`: sets\n  `Phase.ENDING` / `Step.CLEANUP` then calls `advance_phase()`, driving turn\n  rotation through the exact documented public API.\n\nNew tests (all PASS — implementation already exists):\n- `test_heads_count_added_to_target_opponent_skipped_turns` — seed the game (X > 0\n  for the chosen seed), resolve −7 against the opponent, assert\n  `opponent.skipped_turns` equals the heads count that same seed produces.\n- `test_all_heads_seed_skips_five_turns` — all-heads seed (X = 5) sets the\n  opponent's `skipped_turns` to the maximum five (upper bound of the ability).\n- `test_zero_heads_seed_adds_no_skipped_turns` — a zero-heads seed (X = 0) adds no\n  skipped turns (validates the deferred \"X can be 0\" case directly from a seed).\n- `test_skipped_turns_added_to_opponent_not_controller` — the skips accrue on the\n  targeted opponent, never on the controller (`controller.skipped_turns == 0`).\n- `test_ultimate_drives_opponent_to_skip_its_next_turns` — end-to-end: after the\n  seeded −7, drive rotation X times and assert the opponent (seat 1) never becomes\n  active while its due turns are burned, the counter decrements to 0, and normal\n  alternation then resumes (opponent finally takes a turn).\n- `test_skip_counter_decrements_one_per_skipped_turn` — the counter is consumed\n  exactly one-per-skipped-turn, decreasing monotonically by 1 each rotation\n  (not all at once).\n- `test_zero_heads_ultimate_does_not_skip_any_turn` — end-to-end X = 0: the\n  opponent takes its normal next turn immediately (no skip).\n- `test_no_target_ultimate_adds_no_skips_to_either_player` — with no target stashed\n  the −7 is a no-op even under a five-heads seed; neither player accrues skips.\n- `test_seeded_resolution_matches_standalone_flip_coins` — cross-check that the\n  seeded ability consumes the RNG identically to a standalone `flip_coins(g, 5)`\n  on a same-seeded game, proving X is drawn from the documented coin-flip API.\n\nThese supersede both entries in `untestable.json` (deterministic head count, and\nthe end-to-end \"skips their next X turns\" turn-advancement), which are now fully\ncovered."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":229,"cache_read_input_tokens":58136,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":229,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PJsLyamRY5s6LsmWNDw4TW","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"dbfc58d0-abe6-43e3-a9d6-0a15591b5b09","request_id":"req_011Cbe8x5wtVhvWzVxd7xJAe","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_97 ultimate"}
