{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014CxmN6jVgwNzPcYHbSmTh9","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/game.py:21:    DrawsCardTriggeredEvent,\nengine/game.py:294:def draw_card(game: GameState, player: Player) -> Any | None:\nengine/game.py:324:    if not hasattr(player, \"cards_drawn_this_turn\"):\nengine/game.py:325:        player.cards_drawn_this_turn = 0\nengine/game.py:326:    player.cards_drawn_this_turn += 1\nengine/game.py:332:            DrawsCardTriggeredEvent(player=player, card=card),\nRUN_DECISIONS.md:41:- Engine already has `draw_card()` firing `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent` and `player.cards_drawn_this_turn`.\nRUN_DECISIONS.md:42:- **Decision (a)**: direct Implementer to build an additive Miracle framework: (i) a continuous grant making instants/sorceries in the controller's hand have miracle {2}, exposed via a queryable surface (method on the card and/or attribute on the hand card) so the 4 skipped tests become real passes; (ii) a draw-time hook that, on the first draw of the turn (DrawsCardTriggeredEvent + cards_drawn_this_turn == 1) of a granted card, offers the drawer a cast at the miracle cost.\nengine/events.py:64:class DrawsCardTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:27:| `game.py` | 610+ | `create_game()` (life/library/shuffle/draw-7), 11 helper actions (`deal_damage`, `destroy`, `sacrifice`, `exile`, `draw_card`, `discard`, `create_token`, `add_counter`, `remove_counter`, `tap`, `untap`), `run_game()` loop with SBA checking and `MAX_TURNS` safety. `destroy()`, `sacrifice()`, `exile()` delegate to `move_to_zone()`. `deal_damage()` checks protection before applying damage. Tracks `cards_drawn_this_turn` in `draw_card()`. |\ncards/fdn/fdn_37/card_impl.py:6:from engine.events import DrawsCardTriggeredEvent\ncards/fdn/fdn_37/card_impl.py:54:        game.trigger_manager.register(TriggerRegistration(event_type=DrawsCardTriggeredEvent, condition=_draw_condition, effect=_draw_effect, source=self, controller=controller))\ncards/fdn/fdn_41/card_impl.py:6:from engine.events import DrawsCardTriggeredEvent\ncards/fdn/fdn_41/card_impl.py:56:        game.trigger_manager.register(TriggerRegistration(event_type=DrawsCardTriggeredEvent, condition=_draw_condition, effect=_draw_effect, source=self, controller=controller))\ncards/fdn/spg_75/card_impl.py:7:from engine.events import DrawsCardTriggeredEvent\ncards/fdn/spg_75/card_impl.py:94:        reg = TriggerRegistration(event_type=DrawsCardTriggeredEvent, condition=_condition, effect=_effect, source=self, controller=source.controller or source.owner)\ncards/fdn/fdn_47/card_impl.py:6:from engine.events import DrawsCardTriggeredEvent\ncards/fdn/fdn_47/card_impl.py:57:        game.trigger_manager.register(TriggerRegistration(event_type=DrawsCardTriggeredEvent, condition=_draw_condition, effect=_draw_effect, source=self, controller=controller))\ncards/fdn/fdn_33/card_impl.py:6:from engine.events import DrawsCardTriggeredEvent\ncards/fdn/fdn_33/card_impl.py:45:        game.trigger_manager.register(TriggerRegistration(event_type=DrawsCardTriggeredEvent, condition=_draw_condition, effect=_draw_effect, source=self, controller=controller))"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SxABS2LYMPLt5MCvzy5rCk","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"818d3057-578b-42ac-a452-3a2608d6418e","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:09:24.039Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_201"}
