{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MUxoV4jbequmfC1k1BL84T","type":"tool_result","content":"FILES_MODIFIED.json:75:          \"summary\": \"additive Miracle framework (CR 702.94): queryable grant surface (get/set/has_miracle_cost, grant_miracle_to_hand/clear_miracle_grants scoped to controller's hand instants/sorceries via lazy game._miracle_grants), draw-time cast hook register_miracle_draw_hook gated to first draw (cards_drawn_this_turn==1) offering offer_miracle_cast paying only the miracle cost; Miracle kept off the Keyword enum\"\nengine/game.py:294:def draw_card(game: GameState, player: Player) -> Any | None:\nengine/game.py:324:    if not hasattr(player, \"cards_drawn_this_turn\"):\nengine/game.py:325:        player.cards_drawn_this_turn = 0\nengine/game.py:326:    player.cards_drawn_this_turn += 1\nRUN_DECISIONS.md:41:- Engine already has `draw_card()` firing `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent` and `player.cards_drawn_this_turn`.\nRUN_DECISIONS.md:42:- **Decision (a)**: direct Implementer to build an additive Miracle framework: (i) a continuous grant making instants/sorceries in the controller's hand have miracle {2}, exposed via a queryable surface (method on the card and/or attribute on the hand card) so the 4 skipped tests become real passes; (ii) a draw-time hook that, on the first draw of the turn (DrawsCardTriggeredEvent + cards_drawn_this_turn == 1) of a granted card, offers the drawer a cast at the miracle cost.\nengine/miracle.py:27:   they drew this turn* (``player.cards_drawn_this_turn == 1``), offers that\nengine/miracle.py:206:    :func:`engine.game.draw_card` increments ``player.cards_drawn_this_turn``\nengine/miracle.py:208:    draw of the turn sees ``cards_drawn_this_turn == 1`` at trigger time.\nengine/miracle.py:210:    return getattr(player, \"cards_drawn_this_turn\", 0) == 1\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:27:| `game.py` | 610+ | `create_game()` (life/library/shuffle/draw-7), 11 helper actions (`deal_damage`, `destroy`, `sacrifice`, `exile`, `draw_card`, `discard`, `create_token`, `add_counter`, `remove_counter`, `tap`, `untap`), `run_game()` loop with SBA checking and `MAX_TURNS` safety. `destroy()`, `sacrifice()`, `exile()` delegate to `move_to_zone()`. `deal_damage()` checks protection before applying damage. Tracks `cards_drawn_this_turn` in `draw_card()`. |\nengine/events.py:64:class DrawsCardTriggeredEvent(TriggeredEvent):"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01KJbA7QyF9c3QV9RxaZh8H1","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"b59a4277-1969-4f06-b462-d6571300b7bf","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:15:36.488Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend tests for sos_201 miracle draw"}
