rn DISPUTE instead — but note this bug was already confirmed genuine, so a fix is expected.\n- ADDITIVE engine changes only: you may add new methods/classes/helpers/fields/parameters (with safe defaults) and modify existing function BODIES, but never rename/move/delete existing engine symbols. The `Keyword` enum MUST stay at exactly 16 members.\n- All 29 tests in `cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` must pass (instants AND the sorcery).\n- Full `pytest` from `/workspace` must show NO regressions.\n\nVerification you must run:\n- `pytest cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` → all pass.\n- `pytest` from `/workspace` → no regressions (report the totals).\n\nOutputs (write all of these):\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl.diff` — full git diff of your implementation+engine changes (NOT test files).\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-rationale.md` — updated rationale, including exactly how you made the miracle draw-cast bypass sorcery-speed timing without weakening normal enforcement.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-files.txt` — list of files you changed.\n- Upsert the sos_201 entry in `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: sos_201`, replace in place).\n\nReturn one of:\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: <N>\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: <one-line>\n\nor:\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: <N>\ndisputed_tests: <list>\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-dispute.md\nnotes: <one-line>","agentId":"a6c688b28a37299d5","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All work is complete and verified.\n\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: 3\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: Added additive `ignore_timing=False` param to `engine.casting.cast_spell`; miracle draw-cast now calls it with `ignore_timing=True` so granted sorceries cast at draw time (CR 702.94a) an