\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-files.txt` — list of test file paths.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/untestable.json` — JSON array of requirements you could NOT test yet + what would unblock each (empty `[]` if none).\n\nReturn a short status summary:\nTESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_count: <N>\nred_confirmed: <yes/no — how many fail vs skip against the stub>\nuntestable_count: <N>\ntest_files_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-files.txt","uuid":"daa2890e-9d9e-49d7-913c-2d985cfdff0a","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc"}
