{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_015afYzaGXgJwxvBTi8MYo8y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DQbhcNeQm1wGP9MiEisJq7","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/untestable.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"card_id\": \"sos_245\",\n    \"requirement\": \"Instant and sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures. (Affinity for creatures: this spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature you control.) — driving the GRANTED reduction through the live cast/cost pipeline so that casting a granted instant/sorcery while controlling N creatures actually pays {N} less.\",\n    \"why_untestable\": \"There is no engine affinity pipeline. engine.casting.get_cost_reduction only queries the cast card's own cost_reduction(game) hook and clamps it to that card's generic mana; there is no mechanism for cast_spell to apply a per-spell cost reduction that another permanent (Witherbloom) grants to the controller's instants/sorceries. So the granted, count-based reduction cannot be asserted through an actual cast. The tests therefore probe only the GRANT SURFACE (that the controller's instants/sorceries are flagged as having affinity for creatures, scoped to the controller, instants/sorceries only, on-battlefield only) and the per-spell reduction VALUE end-to-end is deferred.\",\n    \"what_would_unblock_it\": \"An additive engine hook that lets a granting permanent contribute a per-spell generic cost reduction recognised by cast_spell / get_cost_reduction — e.g. a registry (mirroring engine.casualty / engine.miracle grant registries) that, when computing a spell's effective cost, adds the granted affinity-for-creatures reduction equal to the number of creatures the caster controls (clamped to the spell's generic), plus a query (e.g. game-level get_effective_cost or an extended get_cost_reduction that consults granted reductions). Once that exists, re-invoke the Tester to add: cast a granted instant while controlling N creatures and assert the generic paid drops by min(N, spell.generic), with scoping (controller-only, instants/sorceries-only, off-battlefield-off) driven through the pipeline.\"\n  }\n]\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3416,"cache_read_input_tokens":95953,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3416,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":66,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01P7xZZQySF9L4KiVzkCHLvW","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"b78b7c44-6618-40d0-a846-22d2efa664c0","request_id":"req_011CbeDpH11g6hUb5gtmDZ78","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_245"}
