{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016odhseHUmdXXegxKNtWDMz","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"card_id\": \"sos_245\",\n4\t    \"requirement\": \"Instant and sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures. (Affinity for creatures: this spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature you control.) — driving the GRANTED reduction through the live cast/cost pipeline so that casting a granted instant/sorcery while controlling N creatures actually pays {N} less.\",\n5\t    \"why_untestable\": \"There is no engine affinity pipeline. engine.casting.get_cost_reduction only queries the cast card's own cost_reduction(game) hook and clamps it to that card's generic mana; there is no mechanism for cast_spell to apply a per-spell cost reduction that another permanent (Witherbloom) grants to the controller's instants/sorceries. So the granted, count-based reduction cannot be asserted through an actual cast. The tests therefore probe only the GRANT SURFACE (that the controller's instants/sorceries are flagged as having affinity for creatures, scoped to the controller, instants/sorceries only, on-battlefield only) and the per-spell reduction VALUE end-to-end is deferred.\",\n6\t    \"what_would_unblock_it\": \"An additive engine hook that lets a granting permanent contribute a per-spell generic cost reduction recognised by cast_spell / get_cost_reduction — e.g. a registry (mirroring engine.casualty / engine.miracle grant registries) that, when computing a spell's effective cost, adds the granted affinity-for-creatures reduction equal to the number of creatures the caster controls (clamped to the spell's generic), plus a query (e.g. game-level get_effective_cost or an extended get_cost_reduction that consults granted reductions). Once that exists, re-invoke the Tester to add: cast a granted instant while controlling N creatures and assert the generic paid drops by min(N, spell.generic), with scoping (controller-only, instants/sorceries-only, off-battlefield-off) driven through the pipeline.\"\n7\t  }\n8\t]\n9\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011ZQCTY2TPiZpW5s2RVhLVB","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"8866a5c3-3d44-49d4-8df0-4f182e8b27b7","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:48:55.007Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_245 + affinity grant hook"}
