{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011ZQCTY2TPiZpW5s2RVhLVB","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All output files are written. Summary of what I did:\n\n- **Card** `cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py`: `WitherbloomTheBalancer(Creature)` with statics ({6}{B}{G}, 5/5, LEGENDARY, Dragon+Elder, Flying+Deathtouch, colors B+G, \"Affinity\" as a printed label — enum stays at 16). Own affinity via `cost_reduction(game)` = creatures the controller controls. Granted-affinity surface via `has_affinity_for_creatures(game, spell)` (recognised first by the tolerant probe) plus the `affinity_for_creatures` attribute flagged onto hand spells. Wires a continuous grant and registers a granted per-spell reduction in `register_triggers`/`register_replacement_effects`.\n- **New module** `engine/affinity.py`: mirrors `engine/casualty.py`/`engine/miracle.py` — lazy per-game `game._affinity_flags` (grant surface) and `game._affinity_grants` keyed by `id(source)` (granted-reduction registry: `register_affinity_grant`/`clear_affinity_grant`/`get_granted_reduction`).\n- **Engine body change** `engine/casting.py::get_cost_reduction`: additively sums `get_granted_reduction(game, card, controller)` into the card's own `cost_reduction` before the existing clamp. Returns 0 when no grant is registered, so sos_1/fdn_167 and all engine cost-reduction tests are unaffected.\n\nVerification: `pytest cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py` → 27 passed; full `pytest` → 1457 passed, 0 failed; `engine_tests/test_cost_reduction.py`, `test_types.py` (16-member Keyword), and sos_1 all green.\n\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: 3\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: Witherbloom own affinity via cost_reduction + new additive engine/affinity.py grant+reduction registry; get_cost_reduction now sums granted reductions (0 when none, so sos_1/fdn_167 unaffected); 27/27 card tests, 1457 full-suite pass."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ac5941a03d8f2cb9c (use SendMessage with to: 'ac5941a03d8f2cb9c' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 101514\ntool_uses: 43\nduration_ms: 269641</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"979fadbb-dac1-4d1e-bab0-acde269c8f4b","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:53:21.130Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Card: sos_245 \"Witherbloom, the Balancer\". Implement the card AND build an additive engine hook so a granting permanent can contribute a per-spell cost reduction (granted affinity-for-creatures) recognised by the cast/cost pipeline.\n\nRead these first (in order):\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/coordinator-directives.md` — your full task. READ THE WHOLE FILE.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-rationale.md` — the Tester's behaviour contract and exactly which grant-surface method/attribute names the tolerant probes recognise.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/untestable.json` — the deferred item you must make testable (driving the granted reduction through the live cast/cost pipeline).\n- `cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py` — the 27 tests you must make pass. You MUST NOT modify this file (the only entry in `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-files.txt`).\n\nWorkspace context:\n- `/workspace/AGENTS.md`, `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md`, `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md`, `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json`.\n- The cost-reduction convention is documented in KEY_DECISIONS.md (from sos_1 / fdn_167 Tolarian Terror): a card exposes `cost_reduction(self, game) -> int` (raw count), and `engine.casting.get_cost_reduction` clamps it to the spell's generic portion. READ `engine/casting.py` to see `get_cost_reduction` / `cast_spell` and how effective cost is computed.\n- The grant-surface + lazy-per-game-registry pattern is in `engine/miracle.py` (sos_201) and `engine/casualty.py` (sos_226) — mirror it.\n- FDN reference: `cards/fdn/fdn_167/card_impl.py` (Tolarian