ery gets no granted reduction; and with Witherbloom OFF the battlefield, no granted reduction applies. Drive these through the cost computation, not just the flag surface.\n4. **Witherbloom's own affinity end-to-end** (if not already pinned through the engine): its {6}{B}{G} generic drops by the number of creatures controlled, clamped to {6}.\n\nConstraints:\n- REAL passing tests against the now-built pipeline (not skips). Anchor any tolerant probe so a missing surface fails loudly.\n- Do NOT weaken or delete the existing 27 tests.\n- Tests run from `/workspace`; bare imports.\n\nRun `pytest cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py` and confirm the full count passes. If you find a genuine implementation bug (granted reduction doesn't actually apply, wrong clamp, wrong scope, or breaks an existing reduction), write the failing test anyway and describe the bug clearly — do NOT paper over it.\n\nOutputs:\n- Update `cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py`.\n- Update `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-rationale.md` with an \"Extended coverage\" section.\n- Overwrite `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/untestable.json` with `[]` (or any items STILL untestable, with reasons).\n- Keep `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-files.txt` accurate.\n\nReturn a short status summary:\nTESTS_EXTENDED\ntotal_test_count: <N>\nnew_tests: <N>\nall_passing: <yes/no — if no, list failing tests and why>\nuntestable_remaining: <N>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GmEQaTZxgS4sSGe8wEJ5BR","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"7f73440f-9014-473e-8afc-83c0556edc9d","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:53:37.964Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend sos_245 affinity tests"}
