{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011tCjhTfP15Ssyq4tjmsDGH","type":"tool_result","content":"98\t### `TestWitherbloomGrantWiring` (grant-surface anchor — 1 test)\n99\t\n100\t- `test_card_exposes_an_affinity_grant_surface` — the **non-skipping anchor**:\n101\t  the implementation must expose at least one recognised affinity-grant surface\n102\t  (a query method on the card or an attribute on the affected spell). An empty\n103\t  stub exposes none, so this fails loudly even though the scope probes above\n104\t  skip — guaranteeing the granted-affinity contract is never silently green.\n105\t\n106\t## Red-phase confirmation (against the empty stub)\n107\t\n108\t`pytest cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py`: **17 failed, 3 passed, 7 skipped**.\n109\t\n110\t- The 17 failures are the genuine red-phase contracts (statics + positive\n111\t  cost-reduction counts + the grant-surface anchor).\n112\t- The 3 \"passes\" are the **zero-expecting** cost-reduction tests\n113\t  (`test_no_reduction_with_no_creatures`,\n114\t  `test_non_creature_permanents_do_not_count`,\n115\t  `test_only_creatures_you_control_count`). The base `CardImpl.cost_reduction`\n116\t  returns `0`, so these scope/exclusion assertions are already satisfied by the\n117\t  stub — exactly as sos_1's `test_no_reduction_with_empty_graveyard` behaves.\n118\t  They are not vacuous: each pins a real scoping rule (opponents' creatures and\n119\t  non-creatures must not count) and is anchored by the positive-count tests that\n120\t  DO fail red.\n121\t- The 7 skips are: 2 conditional static probes (the optional `colors` /\n122\t  `printed_keywords` surfaces) and the 5 granted-affinity scope probes (no\n123\t  surface on the stub). All five are covered by the non-skipping\n124\t  `test_card_exposes_an_affinity_grant_surface` anchor, which fails red.\n125\t\n126\t## Deferred (see `untestable.json`)\n127\t\n128\tDriving the granted reduction through the live cast/cost pipeline (casting a\n129\tgranted instant while controlling N creatures actually paying `{N}` less) is\n130\tdeferred: the engine's `get_cost_reduction` only consults the cast card's own\n131\t`cost_reduction` hook, with no mechanism to apply a per-spell reduction granted\n132\tby another permanent. Recorded with the unblock requirement so the Coordinator\n133\tcan decide whether to ask the Implementer to add engine support and re-invoke.\n134\t\n135\t## Edge cases deliberately NOT covered\n136\t\n137\t- **Flying/Deathtouch combat behaviour** — engine evergreen keyword mechanics\n138\t  are exercised by `engine_tests/`; testing them here would re-test the engine,\n139\t  not the card.\n140\t- **Legend rule / state-based actions for the legendary supertype** — engine\n141\t  responsibility, out of scope for this card.\n142\t- **Affinity interaction with `{X}` / alternative costs** — Witherbloom has no\n143\t  `{X}` and the affinity only ever reduces the fixed `{6}` generic, so no extra\n144\t  cases are warranted beyond the clamp test."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GmEQaTZxgS4sSGe8wEJ5BR","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"2de3bcd7-4f0e-4d21-a925-48c60f44a7f3","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:58:50.159Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend sos_245 affinity tests"}
{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"a21638c427e47f15a","tool_use_id":"toolu_01GmEQaTZxgS4sSGe8wEJ5BR","description":"Editing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Tester","usage":{"total_tokens":85181,"tool_uses":45,"duration_ms":341036},"last_tool_name":"Edit","uuid":"5e9b7b02-123d-47c0-ab4a-b9d6f9ec3280","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01UJm2u6GX1Rcb7srdFRhWzi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015S9Wdpm6QZZwgw79NVaSM7","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/test-rationale.md","old_string":"## Deferred (see `untestable.json`)\n\nDriving the granted reduction through the live cast/cost pipeline (casting a\ngranted instant while controlling N creatures actually paying `{N}` less) is\ndeferred: the engine's `get_cost_reduction` only consults the cast card's own\n`cost_reduction` hook, with no mechanism to apply a per-spell reduction granted\nby another permanent. Recorded with the unblock requirement so the Coordinator\ncan decide whether to ask the Implementer to add engine support and re-invoke.","new_string":"## Extended coverage — granted reduction through the real cast/cost pipeline\n\nThe originally-deferred item (driving the GRANTED affinity-for-creatures\nreduction through the live cast/cost pipeline) is now built: the Implementer\nadded `engine/affinity.py`'s granted-reduction registry\n(`register_affinity_grant` / `clear_affinity_grant` / `get_granted_reduction`),\nand extended `engine.casting.get_cost_reduction` to SUM the granted reduction\nwith the cast card's own `cost_reduction(game)` hook before clamping to the\nspell's generic. The card wires this in `register_triggers` /\n`register_replacement_effects` (`_register_affinity_reduction`). With this in\nplace I added **14 real passing end-to-end tests** (file unchanged otherwise —\nthe original 27 are intact). All assertions drive the COST COMPUTATION\n(`engine.casting.get_cost_reduction`) and/or an actual `engine.casting.cast_spell`,\nnot just the grant flag surface.\n\nHelpers added (no existing helper modified): `_bear`, `_big_instant`\n(`{4}{R}` default so the reduction value is observable before clamping),\n`_vanilla_sorcery_generic2` (`{2}{B}` for the clamp), `_SelfReducingInstant`\n(carries its own `cost_reduction` of 1 to prove SUM-then-clamp), and\n`_setup_grant` (installs Witherbloom + calls `register_triggers` so the\ngranted-reduction registry is live before the cost is computed).\n\n### `TestWitherbloomGrantedReductionPipeline` (granted reduction value/payment — 7 tests)\n\n- `test_granted_reduction_applies_below_generic` — Witherbloom + 2 bears = 3\n  creatures; a `{4}{R}` instant's generic is reduced by `min(3, 4) = 3`, driven\n  through `get_cost_reduction`.\n- `test_granted_reduction_clamped_to_generic` — 5 creatures vs a `{2}{B}` sorcery\n  (generic 2): the granted reduction is clamped to 2, proving generic can't go\n  below 0 in the summed/clamped pipeline (the clamp the deferred item asked to\n  prove).\n- `test_granted_reduction_scales_with_creature_count` — with only Witherbloom\n  (1 creature) the reduction is exactly 1, proving the value is the live count\n  not a constant.\n- `test_granted_reduction_paid_through_cast_spell` — full `cast_spell`: a\n  `{4}{R}` instant is castable funding only `{1}{R}` (3 creatures), and\n  `spell.mana_spent == 2`, proving the reduction is applied AT PAYMENT TIME.\n- `test_unreduced_spell_cannot_be_cast_with_reduced_funding` — negative control:\n  the SAME `{4}{R}` instant with the SAME `{1}{R}` funding but WITHOUT Witherbloom\n  raises `CastingError`, proving the prior cast succeeded BECAUSE of the grant.\n- `test_granted_reduction_stacks_with_spells_own_reduction` — a granted spell\n  that ALSO has its own `cost_reduction` (returns 1): granted 3 + own 1 = 4,\n  generic 6, so the summed reduction is 4 (the \"stacking\" case).\n- `test_stacked_reduction_clamps_to_generic` — granted 5 + own 1 = 6 against a\n  `{2}{R}` spell (generic 2): the SUM is clamped to 2.\n\n### `TestWitherbloomGrantedReductionScopePipeline` (scope through the pipeline — 4 tests)\n\nEvery exclusion is driven through `get_cost_reduction` (not the flag surface) and\nanchored on a positive case so a broken scope (granting everything) fails loudly.\n\n- `test_creature_spell_gets_no_granted_reduction` — a creature spell in hand gets\n  0 granted reduction; anchored against a parallel instant that IS reduced.\n- `test_opponents_spell_gets_no_granted_reduction` — an opponent's instant\n  (controller `p2`) gets 0; anchored against the controller's own instant\n  reduced by 3.\n- `test_no_granted_reduction_while_off_battlefield` — Witherbloom in hand (not on\n  the battlefield) contributes 0; anchored against an on-battlefield positive\n  case reduced by 3.\n- `test_granted_reduction_stops_after_witherbloom_leaves` — after Witherbloom\n  leaves and its grant is cleared (re-running the wiring as the engine would on a\n  board change), the same instant drops from a 3 reduction to 0.\n\n### `TestWitherbloomOwnAffinityEndToEnd` (own affinity through `cast_spell` — 3 tests)\n\n- `test_own_affinity_paid_through_cast_spell` — controlling 3 creatures, casting\n  Witherbloom's `{6}{B}{G}` pays only `{3}{B}{G}` (`mana_spent == 5`).\n- `test_own_affinity_clamped_to_generic_through_cast_spell` — 9 creatures clamp\n  the `{6}` generic to 6, so Witherbloom costs only `{B}{G}` (`mana_spent == 2`).\n- `test_own_affinity_with_no_creatures_pays_full_through_cast_spell` — 0 creatures\n  means no reduction: the full `{6}{B}{G}` is paid (`mana_spent == 8`).\n\n### Extended-coverage confirmation (against the now-built pipeline)\n\n`pytest cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py`: **41 passed** (27 original + 14 new). No\nimplementation bug found — the granted reduction applies, sums with the spell's\nown reduction, clamps to generic, and is correctly scoped (controller-only,\ninstant/sorcery-only, on-battlefield-only) through both `get_cost_reduction` and\n`cast_spell`. Cross-checked with `engine_tests/test_cost_reduction.py`,\n`engine_tests/test_casting.py` and `cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py` — all green\n(no existing reduction regressed). The `untestable.json` item is now resolved\n(file emptied to `[]`)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1257,"cache_read_input_tokens":83348,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1257,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":54,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GmEQaTZxgS4sSGe8wEJ5BR","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"cee700b1-6b46-434a-bc47-a4e12f74b62d","request_id":"req_011CbeEg94AacNurCgSTqr82","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Extend sos_245 affinity tests"}
