{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xh1gTVbCFo1pADN3GGWLLG","type":"tool_result","content":"526\tdef play_land(game: GameState, player: Player, land_card: CardImpl) -> None:\n527\t    \"\"\"Play *land_card* from *player*'s hand onto the battlefield.\n528\t\n529\t    Requirements (all must hold):\n530\t\n531\t    * *land_card* has :attr:`CardType.LAND`.\n532\t    * *player* is the active player.\n533\t    * Current phase is a main phase.\n534\t    * The stack is empty.\n535\t    * ``player.land_plays_remaining > 0``.\n536\t    * The card is in the player's hand.\n537\t\n538\t    On success the card moves from hand to battlefield and\n539\t    ``land_plays_remaining`` is decremented.\n540\t\n541\t    Raises:\n542\t        CastingError: If any requirement is not met.\n543\t    \"\"\"\n544\t    # Must be a land\n545\t    if CardType.LAND not in land_card.card_types:\n546\t        raise CastingError(\n547\t            f\"Cannot play {land_card.name!r} as a land — not a land card\"\n548\t        )\n549\t\n550\t    # Sorcery-speed timing (active player, main phase, stack empty)\n551\t    if not is_sorcery_speed(game, player):\n552\t        raise CastingError(\n553\t            f\"Cannot play land {land_card.name!r} — must be active player \"\n554\t            \"during main phase with empty stack\"\n555\t        )\n556\t\n557\t    # Land plays remaining\n558\t    if player.land_plays_remaining <= 0:\n559\t        raise CastingError(\n560\t            f\"Cannot play land {land_card.name!r} — no land plays remaining\"\n561\t        )\n562\t\n563\t    # Card must be in hand\n564\t    hand = game.get_hand(player)\n565\t    if not hand.contains(land_card):"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QNA4ces9AkbzirNP9xC9rV","session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"e9d99b51-b523-474f-9985-68debacc65ad","timestamp":"2026-06-02T10:03:18.117Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_257"}
