ise.\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/untestable.json` — the 3 deferred items you must make testable.\n- `cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py` — the 26 tests you must make pass. You MUST NOT modify this file (the only entry in `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-files.txt`).\n\nWorkspace context:\n- `/workspace/AGENTS.md`, `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md`, `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md`, `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json`.\n- Engine source to discover the APIs: `engine/card.py` (Land class, activated/mana abilities, CardImpl._reset_characteristics), `engine/mana.py` (ManaPool — flat dict, no restriction tag yet), `engine/casting.py` (cast_spell payment path, get_cost_reduction), `engine/continuous_effects.py` (Layer.TYPE, Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS / sublayer 7c, DURATION_PERMANENT, DURATION_END_OF_TURN, effect_manager.apply_all, remove_expired), `engine/abilities.py`, `engine/events.py` (SpellCastTriggeredEvent), `engine/triggers.py`.\n- Reference: `cards/fdn/fdn_267/card_impl.py` (Secluded Courtyard) documents the SAME restricted-mana gap in-code — read it. Also find an FDN Land for the basic `{T}: Add {C}` mana-ability shape.\n- The lazy-per-game-registry + grant pattern is in `engine/miracle.py`/`engine/casualty.py`/`engine/affinity.py` — mirror it for the granted pump trigger.\n\nTHE TASK: implement `cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py` (`GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex(Land)`: statics + the two mana abilities + the {5} animation activated ability) and three additive engine mechanisms per the directives:\n1. **Restricted mana** in `engine/mana.py` (tag produced mana with a spend restriction + query surface) and enforce it in `engine/casting.py::cast_spell` (restricted mana pays for instants/sorceries only; rejected for creatures). MUST default to unrestricted so existing mana/casting behavior is byte-for-byte unchanged.\n2. **Land-animation** helper (in `engine/continuous_effects.py` or a new module): `{5}` (guarded \"if not already a creature\") layers CardType.CREATURE onto the land (keeping LAND), grants Subtype.WIZARD, sets a 2/4 body observable via card.power/card.toughness after apply_all; durable until the land leaves play.\n3. **Granted pump trigger**: at {5}-resolution, register (deduped per source in a lazy per-game registry) a SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger gated to the controller's own instant/sorcery casts that adds a Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS (7c) +1/+0 ContinuousEffect with DURATION_END_OF_TURN to the animated land; firing N times → +N/+0, reset at cleanup via remove_expired.\n\nConstraints:\n- ADDITIVE engine changes only: add new methods/classes/helpers/fields/modules and modify existing function BODIES, but never rename/move/delete existing engine symbols. The `Keyword` enum MUST stay at exactly 16 members. Use lazy per-game registries (no GameState.__init__ change).\n- REGRESSION SAFETY IS PARAMOUNT: when no restricted mana / no animation is present, ManaPool, cast_spell, and continuous_effects MUST behave exactly as before. Confirm engine mana/casting/continuous-effect tests and fdn_267 still pass.\n- You MUST NOT modify any test file. If a test is genuinely wrong/impossible, return DISPUTE.\n- If full restricted-mana payment-path enforcement proves infeasible without regressions, fall back to a queryable restriction tag + best-effort enforcement and DOCUMENT it clearly in the rationale.\n\nVerification you must run:\n- `pytest cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py` → all 26 pass.\n- `pytest` from `/workspace` → no regressions (report totals). Explicitly confirm engine mana/casting/continuous-effect tests and fdn_267 pass.\n\nOutputs (write all):\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl.diff` — full git diff of implementation + engine changes (NOT test files).\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md` — rationale: the two mana abilities, the restricted-mana mechanism (surface + enforcement + why existing behavior is unchanged, or documented fallback), the animation helper, the granted pump trigger, what you reused, spec deviations, and \"Conventions for future man-lands / restricted-mana / animation cards\".\n- `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-files.txt` — files changed.\n- Upsert the sos_257 entry in `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` (match by `card: sos_257`; shape `{\"card\",\"tests\":[{\"path\",\"summary\"}],\"implementation\":[{\"path\",\"summary\"}]}`).\n\nReturn one of:\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: <N>\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: <one-line>\n\nor:\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: <N>\ndisputed_tests: <list>\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-dispute.md\nnotes: <one-line>","agentId":"aa3dc3e7b05aa86e1","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All deliverables are written. Final state confirmed:\n- 26/26 sos_257 tests pass; full suite 1497 passed, 0 failed; engine mana/casting/continuous-effects + fdn_267 all green.\n- `impl.diff`, `impl-rationale.md`, `impl-files.txt` written to `$CARD_DIR`.\n- `FILES_MODIFIED.json` upserted in place (exactly one sos_257 entry, sorted).\n\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: 4\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: Built three additive engine mechanisms (restricted mana in engine/mana.py + engine/casting.py, land-animation + granted instant/sorcery pump trigger in new engine/animation.py) and the GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex Land at cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py; all 26 card tests pass and full suite (1497) has no regressions."}],"totalDurationMs":664756,"totalTokens":43512,"totalToolUseCount":67,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":445,"cache_read_input_tokens":42695,"output_tokens":370,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":445},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2