nimated land → it gains CardType.CREATURE while RETAINING CardType.LAND, gains Subtype.WIZARD, and is a 2/4 (card.power == 2, card.toughness == 4 after the effect manager applies). Assert the \"if this land isn't a creature\" guard: activating {5} again while already a creature does NOT re-animate / stack a second body.\n3. **Granted pump trigger**: once animated, casting (or firing the SpellCastTriggeredEvent for) the controller's instant/sorcery gives +1/+0 until end of turn. Fire it N times → power == 2 + N (toughness stays 4). Assert the pump RESETS at cleanup/end of turn (remove_expired sweeps the DURATION_END_OF_TURN effects → power back to 2). Assert it's gated to the CONTROLLER's instant/sorcery casts (an opponent's cast, or a creature cast, does not pump).\n\nConstraints:\n- REAL passing tests against the now-built engine (not skips). Anchor any tolerant probe so a missing surface fails loudly.\n- Do NOT weaken or delete the existing 26 tests.\n- Tests run from `/workspace`; bare imports.\n\nRun `pytest cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py` and confirm the full count passes. If you find a genuine implementation bug (restriction not enforced, wrong animation end state, guard missing, pump doesn't reset, wrong gating), write the failing test anyway and describe the bug clearly — do NOT paper over it.\n\nOutputs:\n- Update `cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`.\n- Update `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md` with an \"Extended coverage\" section (and describe any bug found).\n- Overwrite `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/untestable.json` with `[]` (or any items STILL untestable, with reasons).\n- Keep `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-files.txt` accurate.\n\nReturn a short status summary:\nTESTS_EXTENDED\ntotal_test_count: <N>\nnew_tests: <N>\nall_passing: <yes/no — if no, list failing tests and why>\nuntestable_remaining: <N>"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens"