holdTheHistorian: statics, opponent-upkeep loot trigger, miracle grant + draw-cast hook wiring via engine.miracle\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/casting.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"additive ignore_timing param on cast_spell to bypass the sorcery-speed gate for self-timed casting permissions (miracle)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/miracle.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"additive miracle framework; draw-cast now routes through cast_spell(ignore_timing=True) so granted sorceries cast at draw time and genuine CastingErrors propagate\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"card\": \"sos_226\",\n      \"tests\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_226 Silverquill, the Disputant: static data (4/4 legendary Elder Dragon, {2}{W}{B}, flying+vigilance, B+W), Casualty-as-printed-label-not-enum, and the queryable casualty-1 grant surface (instants/sorceries only, controller-only, off-battlefield off, creature/opponent excluded)\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"implementation\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"SilverquillTheDisputant: statics + get_casualty_value grant query, continuous casualty grant to controller's instants/sorceries via engine.casualty, and SpellCastTriggeredEvent cast hook offering pay-by-sacrifice + spell copy\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"path\": \"engine/casualty.py\",\n          \"summary\": \"additive Casualty framework (CR 702.153): queryable grant surface (get/set/grant_casualty_to_hand, lazy game._casualty_grants), power>=N sacrifice validation (legal_casualty_sacrifices/is_legal_casualty_sacrifice), pay_casualty recording spell.casualty_paid, and copy-on-payment via reused engine.stack.copy_spell (offer_casualty + optional new targets)\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"card\": \"sos_245\",\n      \"tests\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \