{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_017T8o3KvTWV3ENspGAaPjuE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 10 SOS cards are implemented, tested, reviewed, and committed. The run is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nAll 10 requested SOS cards (`1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257`) shipped — each via the TDD red→green→review loop, one commit per card. Final state: **1517 tests passing, 0 failures**, clean working tree (the only uncommitted file is the harness-managed `run_manifest.json`, which I left untouched).\n\n**This session resumed mid-`sos_201` and completed four cards:**\n\n- **sos_201 — Lorehold, the Historian** (Miracle): fixed a genuine bug the Tester surfaced — the draw-time miracle cast routed sorceries through `cast_spell`'s sorcery-speed gate. Added an additive `ignore_timing` opt-in to `cast_spell` (miracle's own casting window per CR 702.94a). 29 tests, 0 strict review issues.\n- **sos_226 — Silverquill, the Disputant** (Casualty): built additive `engine/casualty.py` — queryable grant surface, power≥N sacrifice validation, payment recording, and copy-on-payment reusing the existing `engine.stack.copy_spell` primitive. 36 tests, 0 strict.\n- **sos_245 — Witherbloom, the Balancer** (Affinity): built `engine/affinity.py` granted-cost-reduction registry and extended `get_cost_reduction` to sum granted reductions before clamping (0 when none → prior reductions unchanged). 41 tests, 0 strict.\n- **sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex** (man-land): built three additive mechanisms — restricted mana (`engine/mana.py`/`casting.py`), land-animation + granted end-of-turn pump (`engine/animation.py`). Reviewer caught a **strict** spend-restriction bypass (count-only payability check); revision replaced it with a real per-pip backtracking solve over the non-forbidden pool. 46 tests, fixed and re-verified.\n\n**Engine work stayed strictly additive** — `Keyword` enum still at 16, no symbols renamed/moved/deleted, lazy per-game registries throughout, no `engine_tests/` modifications. All new conventions (Miracle, Casualty, Affinity, restricted-mana/animation frameworks) are documented in `KEY_DECISIONS.md`; per-run arbitration notes are in `RUN_DECISIONS.md`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":232,"cache_read_input_tokens":119619,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":232},"output_tokens":35,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69c150b5-c49a-4f71-a445-032aa09f64bc","uuid":"451281eb-3564-4b6e-95ed-754371e175f6","request_id":"req_011CbeH6exewjQRjyeka7ZxU"}
